<p>
  The Yjs document holds one <code>Y.Text</code> named <code>code</code>, connected to
  CodeMirror 6 with <code>y-codemirror.next</code>. Other people's cursors and
  selections come through awareness. The server has no code-editing logic. It
  saves and forwards these updates the same way it does for every other
  demo. Try typing on the same line in both windows.
</p>
